{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d7f7f3ce518ae2f9","name":"Lightsaber Forms Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-d7f7f3ce518ae2f9","title":"Lightsaber Forms Talent Tree","revision":24952,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:03:09Z","sha256":"3eed7689fe2c13a52a33bf657debe5ab5e36f06f84fe3a4289dd89e9687d6e04","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24952","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lightsaber%20Forms%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d7f7f3ce518ae2f9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have refined your knowledge of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," technique, your blade becoming an extension of your self. Anyone using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," may use one of these forms, but you have the discipline and patience to become a true master of the form.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Why are the Lightsaber Form Talents unique to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Knight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Knight","referenceId":"reference:8a1e23d924066b37"}," Prestige Class? Various Sith Lords have been described as masters of a particular form, and not all of them are former Jedi Knights. Therefore, many would be unable to take the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," associated with the form they have mastered (or possibly invented). Is this a mistake?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," No, it's not a mistake. A Jedi, Sith, or any other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},"-wielding character can use a form- even be considered a master of that form to in-universe observers- without having the associated Lightsaber Form Talent. After all, being a \"master of a form\" is a label that's completely subjective, in- universe, and not based on game mechanics. Someone is a \"master\" if others perceive it to be so. Certainly, someone who takes a Lightsaber Form Talent is probably recognized as a master by others, but that doesn't mean that only someone with a Lightsaber Form Talent can be considered a master.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Lightsaber Form Talents are meant to represent unique benefits that Jedi- with their greater emphasis on meditative and disciplined study, the sublime emptiness of serenity, and patient reflection on the will of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},"- can gain from devoting themselves to a particular form. Sith, meanwhile, are not as meditative, disciplined, serene, or reflective. Instead, they're about passion, rage, strength, and desire, and their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," (such as ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Scourge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Scourge"}]}," and ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Wicked Strike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wicked_Strike"}]},") reflect this.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In any case, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Knight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Knight","referenceId":"reference:8a1e23d924066b37"}," and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Apprentice"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Apprentice","referenceId":"reference:580167d0bdd39739"}," of the same level, both devoting themselves to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," combat, can learn the same number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},"- and combat-related ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"},", but the specific ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," may vary. In other words, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," aren't better than ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," when using a particular form; they're just different.\n"]},"\n","\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ataru"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You may add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus (instead of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus) on damage rolls when wielding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},". When you wield a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," Two-Handed, you may apply double your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus (instead of double your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus) to the damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Djem So"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per round when an opponent hits you with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"},", you may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to make an immediate attack against that opponent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Jar'Kai"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Defense"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Niman"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you use the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Defense"}]}," Talent, you gain twice the normal deflection bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," when you are wielding two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Juyo"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +10, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Lightsabers)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Lightsabers)"},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Specialization (Lightsabers)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Specialization_(Lightsabers)"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to designate a single opponent in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". For the remainder of the encounter, you may reroll your first attack roll each round against that opponent, keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Makashi"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Defense"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When wielding a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," in one hand, the deflection bonus you gain from the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Defense"}]}," Talent increases by 2 (to a maximum of +5).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Niman"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When wielding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", you gain a +1 bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shien"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Redirect Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Redirect_Shot"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you redirect a deflected blaster bolt with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Redirect Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Redirect_Shot"}]}," Talent, you gain a +5 bonus on your ranged attack roll.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shii-Cho"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When using the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," or ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," Talents, you only take a -2 penalty on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check for every previous ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," or ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," attempt since your last turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sokan"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatic Recovery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatic_Recovery"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You may ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," checks to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tumble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tumble"},", even when distracted or threatened. Additionally, each threatened or occupied square that you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tumble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tumble"}," through only counts as 1 square of movement.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Soresu"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You may reroll a failed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check when using the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," or ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," Talents.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Trakata"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +12, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Lightsabers)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Lightsabers)"},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Specialization (Lightsabers)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Specialization_(Lightsabers)"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["By harnessing the unique characteristics of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", you can catch your opponent off guard by quickly shutting off and reigniting the blade. When wielding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", you may spend two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," to make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feint"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feint","referenceId":"reference:82a1660a47a16b62"}," in combat.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vaapad"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +12, ",{"tag":"b","children":["Juyo"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When attacking with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", you score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," on a natural roll of 19 or 20. However, a natural 19 is not considered an automatic hit; if you roll a natural 19 and still miss the target, you do not score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
